  "vetSays": [
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Off to the well — back with a full skin.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 1,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +3 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Thirst doesn't negotiate. Going.\" The pantry won't fill itself."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "You catch fragments by the fire — A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek telling A person, maybe 30s, with a limp about themself. The story's getting bigger than what happened."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "💧 A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek returns with water: +3 clean."
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek looks at you flatly. \"Why should I listen to you?\" (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 2,
      "line": "\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek says. (Trust too low.)"
    },
    {
      "day": 8,
      "line": "🛡️ Riana and Ursula met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 driven off. Ursula is hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 21,
      "line": "🛡️ Ursula, Chantal and Hassan met them at the door — 3 put down. Ursula, Chantal, Hassan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 25,
      "line": "📺 \"Oh, you survived the AUDIENCE NOTES? Cute. We've stopped pretending these are animals now. That was the FINAL DRAFT, folks — what comes out of the treeline next was never alive the way you mean it.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Chantal just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 34,
      "line": "🛡️ Gus, Ursula, Chantal and Hassan met them at the door — 4 put down. Gus, Ursula, Chantal, Hassan are hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 37,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Gus just put down Spool... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 39,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Hassan just put down The Redactor... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 41,
      "line": "📺 \"We've been watching you for a LONG time. Your faiths. Your formats. Your little institutions. So we built something out of... well. Out of YOU. Say hello to the MIRROR DRAFT.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 46,
      "line": "◈ ARC IV — THE INEFFICIENCY. SYSTEM: \"ROUNDING ERROR RECLASSIFIED: ANOMALY. Organic consumption yields impossible output. Recalculating. Recalculating.\" — They finally see it. The thing they laughed at — needing to EAT — is the engine. Their confusion is your weapon now. You stood up to the calibration fauna, the audience's notes, the Final Draft — lived through their Show, weathered the worst together, and built something bigger than a village. One day humanity will need a case to make. The case is made of deeds, not words — and yours, though unfinished, are undeniable. (Feasted buffs burn ho"
    },
    {
      "day": 47,
      "line": "📺 \"But finales — FINALES need a LEGEND, sweetheart. More STANDING — blood, bonds, or bread — and look the Mirror Draft in the eye. The producers are WAITING.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 55,
      "line": "◈ SYSTEM: \"Four waves. FOUR. The producers are — okay, I'm saying it: FINALES need a NATION. You've got a region; now make it a REALM. Bind fires under one head, or bend the knee to someone who has. The higher-ups are watching. ...Did I say higher-ups? I said NOTHING. Forget the higher-ups.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 80,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — scarred, braced, waiting for your opening. A Scarred veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 90,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Ursula just put down Chorus Line... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 101,
      "line": "⚠ This one is different — old, patient, unhurried — it has seen your kind before. An Elder veteran."
    },
    {
      "day": 101,
      "line": "The Elder Loud-Eyes falls."
    },
    {
      "day": 101,
      "line": "📺 +20 style — dropped the Elder Loud-Eyes!"
    },
    {
      "day": 108,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Leo just put down Loud-Eyes... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 136,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Pieter just put down The Callback... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 136,
      "line": "🛡️ Pieter and Nikolai met them at the door — 2 put down. Nikolai is hurt."
    },
    {
      "day": 141,
      "line": "📺 SYSTEM: \"Oh — OH. Everybody saw that, right? Pieter just put down The Herald... on CAMERA. That's a veteran kill, folks. REMEMBER the name.\""
    },
    {
      "day": 144,
      "line": "🛡️ Pieter, Yara and Hisham met them at the door — 1 put down, 1 barely walked away. Hisham didn't come back. Pieter, Yara are hurt."
    }
